00:12:50,430 --> 00:12:52,320
where you could use AI as a solution,

331
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:55,470
so lemme ask you: what made you wanna explore

332
00:12:55,470 --> 00:12:57,810
using AI with your Student Services areas

