00:14:24,870 --> 00:14:27,030
and some of it is in CCApply

368
00:14:27,030 --> 00:14:28,740
and some of it is in this other system

369
00:14:28,740 --> 00:14:29,910
and some of it's over here.

370
00:14:29,910 --> 00:14:31,590
And so we are tracking down

371
00:14:31,590 --> 00:14:33,030
and accessing different systems

372
00:14:33,030 --> 00:14:35,340
to try to find eligibility information.

373
00:14:35,340 --> 00:14:37,830
And then we're still all working in silos, right?

374
00:14:37,830 --> 00:14:40,770
So we've tried to combine it into this giant spreadsheet

375
00:14:40,770 --> 00:14:43,830
where then people are deleting things and moving things

376
00:14:43,830 --> 00:14:44,910
and things are getting lost

377
00:14:44,910 --> 00:14:46,380
and people are super overwhelmed.

378
00:14:46,380 --> 00:14:47,700
It's hard to keep track.

379
00:14:47,700 --> 00:14:49,200
We had duplicate submissions.

380
00:14:49,200 --> 00:14:52,410
We had, you know, people putting the wrong information,

381
00:14:52,410 --> 00:14:54,060
the incorrect ID number, their...

382
00:14:54,060 --> 00:14:56,370
You know, so we spent so much time

383
00:14:56,370 --> 00:14:58,320
just trying to clean up data

384
00:14:58,320 --> 00:15:00,780
and find accurate data to figure out

385
00:15:00,780 --> 00:15:03,090
whether or not students were eligible for programs.

386
00:15:03,090 --> 00:15:05,850
And then it took us so much longer to get back to them.

387
00:15:05,850 --> 00:15:08,220
And when we did communicate, it was a lot of back and forth

388
00:15:08,220 --> 00:15:09,900
of, like, "we still need pieces from you"

