00:15:11,520 --> 00:15:15,060
So it was taking very long to get students connected,

391
00:15:15,060 --> 00:15:16,770
and we were literally looking at this

392
00:15:16,770 --> 00:15:19,050
like "there has to be a better way," right?

393
00:15:19,050 --> 00:15:22,773
So the solution was to integrate AI.

394
00:15:24,300 --> 00:15:27,180
- Great, I'm Joel Bennett, director,

395
00:15:27,180 --> 00:15:29,220
Educational Technology at West Valley-Mission.

