00:17:00,660 --> 00:17:05,010
has unique eligibility status, or requirements.

433
00:17:05,010 --> 00:17:07,230
So again, advisors see

434
00:17:07,230 --> 00:17:10,530
clear AI-generated breakdown of eligibility.

435
00:17:10,530 --> 00:17:12,120
What's the impact? Right?

436
00:17:12,120 --> 00:17:13,980
Now, Amanda and others can focus

